Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.75,0:00:09.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,别掉下去啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.46,0:00:10.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:15.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,维罗妮卡大人的店“魅魔之翼”\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:16.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,倒了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:21.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,销售额跌得那么惨吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:23.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 我说的“倒”\n指的是物理意义上的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.64,0:00:25.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,物理意义上的？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:30.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,说是店塌了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.53,0:00:32.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,天谴啊天谴！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.53,0:00:41.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那可是我从贫民窟\n白手起家一路打拼…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:44.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易才开起来的店啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.42,0:00:47.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没必要哭成这样吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.33,0:00:48.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:52.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等我要回去的时候\n你能陪我一起吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:55.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过店还得重建\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.97,0:00:57.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以钱可能给不了太多…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.85,0:01:00.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但我有点不安…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.18,0:01:03.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,去亚纳戈啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:05.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你了阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:09.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真拿你没办法啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:11.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你阿始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.73,0:01:14.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有男人在就安心多了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.37,0:01:19.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,骗到了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.83,0:01:23.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,店里的女孩子们没事吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.41,0:01:26.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 这也算是不幸中的万幸\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:29.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊 太好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:33.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过如果是\n有人故意破坏了我的店的话…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.55,0:01:37.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我会让他见识什么叫地狱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.95,0:02:04.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29岁单身中坚冒险者的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.61,0:03:18.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（第6话 决战！进攻地下城）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.61,0:03:21.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好大的建筑啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.07,0:03:23.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.49,0:03:26.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们追着影子跑！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:28.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:33.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这城墙还是老样子 把影子拉得真长\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:37.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,行了行了 别耍帅了快走啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:40.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我才没耍帅呢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:46.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我的店啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.76,0:03:48.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,变得乱七八糟的了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.60,0:03:50.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这坏得可真彻底啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.89,0:03:52.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:54.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不可以进警戒线里面噢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.19,0:03:58.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,老板娘？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.11,0:04:02.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是玛莉贝尔嘛 你在干嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.32,0:04:03.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我在打工啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:05.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 当时可乱套了你知道吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.95,0:04:08.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,店突然就塌了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.41,0:04:09.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且弄塌它的还是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:13.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好久不见啊 维罗妮卡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:18.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,雀斑杰西…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.46,0:04:18.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（通过化妆遮住了）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:19.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不准叫我雀斑！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.34,0:04:22.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过还真是可惜啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:24.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你好像失去了你的店啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.01,0:04:28.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原来是你干的啊 我宰了你哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.35,0:04:31.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,才不是我的错！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.81,0:04:32.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,店会塌\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:35.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为迷雾龙落在屋顶上歇脚啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.65,0:04:36.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这是事实\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.23,0:04:39.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今早公会已经发布公告了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:42.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,半夜飞来的迷雾龙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.36,0:04:44.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在屋顶上歇脚的时候\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:47.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,房子承受不住它的体重所以塌了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:50.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,糟了！怪物灾害保险\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:52.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我偏偏没报\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.41,0:04:54.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龙类的附加险！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.46,0:04:57.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,话说你该感谢我才对吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:04:59.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你店里那些无处可去的女孩子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:01.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,现在可是我在照顾\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.46,0:05:03.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是挺好吗 维罗妮卡\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.30,0:05:05.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那位姐姐是好人呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.55,0:05:07.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,她才没那么好心…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.76,0:05:08.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.89,0:05:12.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,做个交易吧 店修好之前\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:15.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那些女孩子我来照顾\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.73,0:05:17.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,作为交换…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:19.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,利夏特大人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.23,0:05:22.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你别再把他当作奴隶对待了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:23.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,利夏特？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.03,0:05:25.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,利夏特？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:26.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,利夏特？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.41,0:05:29.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:30.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,波奇\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:31.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,汪！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.74,0:05:34.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:37.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我说的就是让你别把人当狗使唤啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:41.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,说起来你是迷上这家伙了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.63,0:05:45.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:48.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你要是肯帮我出全部的重建费用\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.76,0:05:50.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不是不能考虑\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:52.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你也太贪了吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:58.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,反正我也知道你不会乖乖答应啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:06:01.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就用攻略地下城来决胜负如何？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.61,0:06:03.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你赢了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.07,0:06:05.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,重建费用的一半\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:07.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以付给你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.65,0:06:11.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过要是你输了\n就得放了利夏特大人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.32,0:06:12.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而你本人要当我的仆人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:14.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,给我干活！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:18.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 正合我意\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:23.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,话是这么说\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:25.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有点不妙啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:27.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很好吃啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:29.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是在说吃饭的事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:33.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对手把地下城的地图都买断了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:35.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还雇了虎人队\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:37.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊\n-虎人队\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:38.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（地下城 专门攻略地下城“戈文的祭坛”的虎人冒险者队伍 虎人（虎人队））\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.27,0:06:41.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,她肯定会先下手为强啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:44.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 那个女人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.27,0:06:45.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,请放心！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.11,0:06:49.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是输了 我就不能待在你身边了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.53,0:06:51.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,既然如此我利夏特…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.45,0:06:53.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,明天一定会拿出真本事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.79,0:06:57.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,其实输掉也行吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:01.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不行！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:03.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我还要让她出重建费呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:06.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,味噌兔排真好吃啊 阿始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:07.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.63,0:07:10.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（地下城“戈文的祭坛”）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:13.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎你的到来 维罗妮卡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.85,0:07:15.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:18.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,完全没准备好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.93,0:07:20.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,太感谢了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:22.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么啊！还要打利夏特大人！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.23,0:07:27.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,比赛是5对5的团队战\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.03,0:07:29.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,能够击败\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.28,0:07:32.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,中层Boss“复苏的魔物”\n就算胜利\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.49,0:07:36.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 开始进攻地下城！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.24,0:07:40.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,目标是以最快速度通关\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.37,0:07:41.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,全力上吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:42.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:47.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等等别把我丢下啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.01,0:07:54.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,利夏特大人！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.23,0:08:06.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,心动 利夏特大人…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:09.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛啊！笨蛋\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.03,0:08:13.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,别在比赛中突然展现抖M属性啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.61,0:08:14.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:16.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,陷阱看起来很棒\n所以我一不小心就…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:20.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你对利夏特大人做了什么啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.50,0:08:21.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.50,0:08:22.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这不乱成一团了嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.46,0:08:24.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,虎人队都要跑到前面去了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:26.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐要输了啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:27.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:28.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,再多对我…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.51,0:08:37.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来这是条死路啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.51,0:08:39.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,震惊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.31,0:08:43.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,堂堂铜等级冒险者莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.10,0:08:44.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,走到死路了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:07.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,隐藏楼梯！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.58,0:09:10.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（与此同时 在另一边…）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.05,0:09:18.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是宝箱！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.73,0:09:30.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 是大人的尺寸啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:32.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,行了 快穿上试试\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,迷宫宝箱里开出的装备啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:58.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,会变成最先穿上的人的尺寸\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.26,0:10:04.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好强！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.06,0:10:06.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那可不一定\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:09.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不能在这磨蹭了！得赶紧走！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:11.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好好好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.65,0:10:16.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（复苏的魔物LV.15 步行金鯱）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:24.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始 有个金闪闪的怪东西\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.62,0:10:26.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙大概就是Boss了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:32.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以说别急啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.84,0:10:35.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这次就别拦我了 阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.46,0:10:37.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,当然要拦！以你的等级\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.88,0:10:39.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,正面硬刚是不可能的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:42.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要打就拉开距离用魔法 魔法！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.64,0:10:44.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,诶？可是阿始…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:47.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露能用的魔法只能做魔法淋浴哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:50.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,总之先打了再说\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.23,0:10:52.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟比起那时 你的等级提升了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:54.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,装备也换新了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.94,0:10:57.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我觉得莉露用剑\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.36,0:11:00.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,会比用棍子更强啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:03.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是“棍子”是“法杖” \n放轻松打\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:12.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 莉露果然\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:14.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在这方面更有天赋啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:17.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.68,0:11:31.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的猎物！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:34.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,最后一击被莉露拿下啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.32,0:11:36.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你还真够自信的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.36,0:11:39.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这小鬼…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:43.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,挺能干的嘛 明明个子这么小！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:46.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 时机抓得真准\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.53,0:11:48.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这么小年纪就这么厉害\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:50.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然莉露用剑更强\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.46,0:11:52.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但用法杖也很厉害的说\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.79,0:11:55.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怪被抢走了你们都不生气吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.59,0:12:06.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 都已经打倒了吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:10.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁打倒的？阿始？虎人队？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.81,0:12:14.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,咦？莉露酱？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.31,0:12:19.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧！太厉害了莉露酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.24,0:12:21.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还好啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:23.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露其实挺厉害的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.36,0:12:24.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,输了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.07,0:12:27.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了！半价半价\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.53,0:12:29.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们两个啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:37.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29岁单身中坚冒险者的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:43.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是始先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.17,0:12:44.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真帅气\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.63,0:12:46.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好酷\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.93,0:12:49.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吧是吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:52.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你战斗都是为了我们对吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.68,0:12:53.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那当然啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:55.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真可靠\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:04.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始 不是要去买特产吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.36,0:13:06.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛啊莉露！我正聊得开心呢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.28,0:13:09.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也不用这么急吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:12.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天傍晚不是就要出城了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.20,0:13:15.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,诶 这么快就要走了吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:18.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还想多跟你聊聊啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.34,0:13:18.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等等！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:20.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 我也想聊 我也想聊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.55,0:13:22.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快走嘛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:24.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,巨乳姐姐们\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:26.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:29.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我难得享受一次后宫的快乐\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.60,0:13:30.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,奥莉芙姐姐不是拜托你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:33.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,带香水回去吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.89,0:13:35.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,香水啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:38.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 去亚纳戈啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.36,0:13:40.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还要待五天\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.15,0:13:41.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.48,0:13:45.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊 五天呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:48.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,梦莓\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.70,0:13:53.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,梦莓香水最近好像很流行哦？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.75,0:13:57.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在亚纳戈那边\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.79,0:13:59.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,香水是什么啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:04.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不就是带点味道的水吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.76,0:14:06.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要卖这么贵啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:10.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,从小在贫民窟长大的我真搞不懂\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.02,0:14:17.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,贫民窟啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.14,0:14:20.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,史莱姆怎样了 始？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.56,0:14:21.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要去打吗！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.11,0:14:23.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我说的是贫民窟啦贫民窟\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:25.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前住的地方\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.11,0:14:28.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,难得来这里一趟\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.32,0:14:29.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,去扫个墓吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.49,0:14:33.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是爸爸妈妈的墓吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:36.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 是当年一起混的同伴啦\n同伴！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.96,0:14:39.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我连父母长什么样都不知道\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.55,0:14:46.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要不今天莉露当你妈妈吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.92,0:14:48.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,免了 这算什么安慰\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:56.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得有些看起来很可怕的人\n在盯着我们\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:14:59.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 人家又不是在看你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:02.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是在盯着看起来很好吃的龙龙啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.41,0:15:17.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子不是食物啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:20.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不可以吃的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:35.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:37.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这家店在卖垃圾啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.18,0:15:40.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,居然说是垃圾…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.48,0:15:43.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被说成垃圾了哦 波姆老头！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:45.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哼 吵死了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.02,0:15:47.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你这贫民窟的小混蛋\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.36,0:15:49.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,小混蛋？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.61,0:15:50.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:52.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你小子又要回到这里啦？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:55.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 只是因为工作路过了而已\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.25,0:16:00.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你女儿？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:03.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 是捡来的小鬼\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:04.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,捡来的？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.50,0:16:09.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊 还挺温柔的嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.55,0:16:10.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:13.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那以后不如就叫你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:14.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,“贫民窟的小天使”吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.43,0:16:16.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我宰了你啊老头！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.85,0:16:20.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是老样子啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.93,0:16:23.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 你跟阿始认识吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.98,0:16:27.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,认识啊！从这家伙跟你差不多大时\n我就认识了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.44,0:16:29.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,第一次见面的时候啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.98,0:16:33.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这小子正想偷我店里的东西\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.61,0:16:34.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,偷这家店的东西？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:36.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我想抢回来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:38.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,结果被他拿石头狠狠砸了一下脑袋\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:41.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我气不过\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.33,0:16:43.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,下次再看到他的时候\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:45.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,从背后狠狠踹了他一脚\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:48.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还有这事啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.13,0:16:51.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,说什么 “还有这事啊”\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:54.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是个可怕的地方\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.05,0:16:55.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:16:59.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.76,0:17:02.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始就是在这个地方长大的啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.74,0:17:19.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龙龙被偷了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.58,0:17:21.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始！龙龙被…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:23.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你加油啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:24.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你笑什么啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:28.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-耶 有肉了！\n-龙龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:32.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我生气了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.55,0:17:35.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露超级奇迹射击！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.81,0:17:41.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.22,0:17:43.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁干的？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.14,0:17:46.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂！你这家伙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.94,0:17:48.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你是混哪条街的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.57,0:17:52.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哟 这不是罗顿吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.99,0:17:56.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你小子的地盘扩张了是吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.03,0:17:58.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来挺努力的嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.12,0:18:00.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啊… 是！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:03.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个… 始先生你怎么会在这？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.12,0:18:06.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你怕什么啊 罗顿哥\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:08.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 这人看着眼生啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:09.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.88,0:18:11.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你谁啊你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:14.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,知不知道这里是谁的地盘？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.13,0:18:15.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这可是罗顿哥的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.38,0:18:16.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 笨蛋 别说了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.76,0:18:21.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（贫民窟名产 人肉串）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:23.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,替我向萨尔曼问好啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.85,0:18:25.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哈里斯！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:27.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等等我啊 阿始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:50.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始 那些不是贡品吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:53.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这很正常 我以前也抢过别人的贡品\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.30,0:19:03.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,据说人死了之后 会被火烧掉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.68,0:19:06.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,变成灰 乘着风\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.31,0:19:09.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,飞到太阳那边去\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:11.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那群家伙现在\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.73,0:19:14.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大概飞到哪儿了呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.11,0:19:18.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,到太阳上了没有呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.53,0:19:21.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,希望他们不会饿肚子啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.42,0:19:31.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.88,0:19:35.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因为今天莉露要当妈妈\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.63,0:19:39.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我拒绝过了吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:43.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.30,0:19:47.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始小的时候\n要是莉露也在就好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.73,0:19:50.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那样的话\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.31,0:19:53.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露一定会努力让阿始轻松一点的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:55.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真可惜啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:19:59.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉如果你在 我只会更辛苦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.82,0:20:05.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢款待\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:07.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我在喝你给的酒了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.62,0:20:09.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,别喝太多啊 波姆老头\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.41,0:20:13.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好久没喝酒了 真过瘾啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.00,0:20:17.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始 那边的孩子在干嘛？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.63,0:20:19.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是在钓老鼠\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.34,0:20:21.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,贫民窟小孩赚零花钱的方法\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.93,0:20:23.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始你以前也干过？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.93,0:20:24.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那当然了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.43,0:20:27.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露也要试试！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:31.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就玩一次啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.27,0:20:33.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他们可是要靠这个挣吃饭钱的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.48,0:20:34.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.37,0:20:48.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 那只就不错 那只大的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.49,0:20:51.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,用那边木箱里的绳子绑上\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:54.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.29,0:20:57.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,然后从这座桥上垂下去…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:21:01.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,过一会儿就会有大老鼠过来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.76,0:21:04.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,再用大石头砸死它就行了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.14,0:21:07.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这样绝对不会受伤\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.01,0:21:11.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他们没往虫子上砸对吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.81,0:21:13.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那可是宝贵的诱饵 还能重复利用\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.77,0:21:16.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.11,0:21:20.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要不算了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.28,0:21:26.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要试试！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:29.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天是老鼠肉派对的说！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.62,0:21:33.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 别把虫子弄死啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.41,0:21:36.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 阿始 你也来喝！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.83,0:21:37.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:39.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还没来 再等等…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.75,0:21:42.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,出来了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:47.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-“要是莉露当时也在就好了”吗…\n-出来了 现在可以了吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.55,0:21:50.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然肯定会很辛苦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.35,0:21:52.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想吃那种苦…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:53.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看招！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:54.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 笨蛋！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.93,0:21:58.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始！莉露的虫子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.77,0:22:00.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过应该\n
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.98,0:22:03.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也能一起度过一些快乐的时光吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.04,0:23:40.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（下一话 莉露和可可）\n
